rev_parse 8f17da3d6caf4ab865677afb75925880cc75a149
date_utc 2026-11-13T23:00:16Z
host cursor
uname Linux-6.12.113+-x86_64-with-glibc2.39
machine x86_64
cpu Intel(R) Xeon(R) Processor
nproc 8
python 3.12.3
warmup 1
samples 6
quantile type-7 (numpy percentile method=linear)
order serial, tools alternate each sample index, no parallel samples
page_cache insert: unlink and create the database file each sample
page_cache read_cold: posix_fadvise DONTNEED, then mincore; retry until resident fraction is 0
page_cache read_cold_label: a sample that stays resident is labeled and omitted from the cold median
page_cache drop_caches: /proc/sys/vm/drop_caches is not writable here, so it is not used
page_cache read_warm: one warmup read on the open store, then time the read
lmdb MDB_NOSYNC unset, one write transaction, fsync on commit
ase backend sqlite journal_mode=DELETE synchronous=FULL, one commit fsync
validation element-wise outside the timer; a mismatch aborts the run
ase_settings {"ase_version": "3.29.0", "backend": "sqlite", "fsync": "synchronous=FULL on that commit", "journal_mode": "delete", "sqlite_version": "3.45.1", "synchronous": "FULL", "transactions": "one commit for the whole insert (ASE's 5000-row commit disabled)"}
protocol paper_db_v2 repeats 6 warmup 0 interleaved per-row ase commit
